###Block: Noble Class Features
Weapon and Armor Proficiency	KEY:Noble ~ Weapon and Armor Proficiency	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Noble Class Feature.Class Feature.SpecialQuality	ABILITY:Internal|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=WeaponProfMartial|TYPE=ArmorProfLight|TYPE=ShieldProf	SOURCEPAGE:p.399	DESC:The noble is proficient with all simple and martial weapons, light armor, and shields (except tower shields).
Bonus Class Skill	KEY:Noble ~ Bonus Class Skill	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Noble Class Feature.Class Feature.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.399	DESC:At 1st level, a noble may designate any one cross-class skill as a class skill, an area of study he has pursued on his own.
Favor	KEY:Noble ~ Favor	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Noble Class Feature.Class Feature.SpecialQuality	DEFINE:NobleFavorUses|0	BONUS:VAR|NobleFavorUses|max(1,floor(NobleLVL/2))	SOURCEPAGE:p.399	DESC:The noble can call in favors from contacts, for information or the loan of equipment or documents: a favor check is d20 + %1 (his favor bonus) against a DC of 10 (simple) to 25 (highly dangerous, expensive, or illegal) set by the DM. He can't take 10 or 20 or retry the same favor, and may try %2 times per week (half his noble level, minimum 1), from different contacts. The DM may disallow any favor that would be disruptive.|NobleFavor|NobleFavorUses
Inspire Confidence	KEY:Noble ~ Inspire Confidence	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Noble Class Feature.Class Feature.SpecialQuality	DEFINE:NobleConfidenceAllies|0	BONUS:VAR|NobleConfidenceAllies|floor((NobleLVL+1)/2)	SOURCEPAGE:p.400	DESC:%1/day, the noble can use oratory to inspire confidence in up to %2 allies (half his noble level, rounded up) who listen to and observe him for a full round. For 5 rounds they gain a +2 morale bonus on saving throws and a +1 morale bonus on attack and weapon damage rolls. He can't inspire himself.|NobleConfidenceUses|NobleConfidenceAllies
Coordinate	KEY:Noble ~ Coordinate	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Noble Class Feature.Class Feature.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.400	DESC:When the noble aids others and gives directions, his aid another check provides a +%1 cooperation bonus in addition to the normal +2 aid another bonus (+%2 in total). This ability can't be used to assist in combat.|NobleCoordinate|NobleCoordinate+2
Inspire Greatness	KEY:Noble ~ Inspire Greatness	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Noble Class Feature.Class Feature.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.400	DESC:Once per day, the noble can inspire greatness in a number of allies (%1 now: one at 11th level, one more for every three levels beyond): for 5 rounds each gains +2d6 temporary hit points, a +2 competence bonus on attacks and a +2 morale bonus on saving throws. He can't inspire himself.|NobleGreatnessAllies
